33rd Annual OogaiFest

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.190
That's it for the preparations!

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.310
The cultural festival will finally start tomorrow!

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.740
Let's have a blast!

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.540
Yeah!

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.970
The President's working as hard as ever.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:34.930
Let's hope she doesn't pass out from it.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:36.890
Good work.

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:44.280
Mana, are you okay?!

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.030
Huh...

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:46.030
{OP}

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:52.230
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.700
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:57.570
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:59.610
Every day it sparkles

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:03.280
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:10.200
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:15.850
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:21.490
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:26.930
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:32.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:41.520
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:43.180
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:45.580
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:48.420
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:51.220
What's more than just cute

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:55.090
is our promise between girls

00:01:55.890 --> 00:02:01.130
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:07.040
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:18.980
Mana's Out of Commission!

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:18.980
Mana's Out of Commission!

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:21.070
It's overwork.

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:25.250
I was so worried when I heard you had fainted.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.270
I never knew you were so exhausted...

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.470
Now that I think about it,

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.480
right after that huge crisis the other day,

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.830
Cultural Festival Meeting

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:36.010
she spent every waking moment preparing for the cultural festival.

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:37.980
Talk about overkill.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:41.620
But I knew everyone was looking forward to the festival,

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:43.710
so I just couldn't hold myself back.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:46.310
You won't be much help if you're sick in bed.

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:48.150
Yeah, sorry.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:50.890
Either way, you still have a fever,

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.260
so get some rest tomorrow.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.220
What?!

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:53.980
But the festival—

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.190
Get some rest!

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.810
Okay, good night.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:05.130
Mana is <i>such</i> a Happy Prince.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.100
A Happy Prince?

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.080
What do you mean?

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.190
He's a character in a fairy tale.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.540
And Mana's just like him.

