00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.330
Long ago in a town far away, {Appears to be different from the story Rikka told in ep 2}

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:28.680
there was a golden statue of a prince covered in beautiful jewels.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.780
The prince was very kind-hearted,

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:38.920
and asked a swallow he met to give his jewels to the town's poor.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.010
He gave his own jewels...

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.870
It certainly sounds like something Mana would do.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:48.510
First, he gave his sword's rubies.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:50.870
Next, his sapphire eyes.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.650
Feeling those gifts wouldn't be enough,

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:58.640
the prince gave every part of his golden body to the people.

00:03:58.640 --> 00:03:59.390
And then...

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:04.940
But... why?

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:12.510
The heck's that?

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.680
A Blood Ring.

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:17.390
It's an accessory imbued with powerful magic.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:18.870
Give it a try.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:21.570
You'll become stronger than you ever thought possible.

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:23.670
Yeah, right.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:29.130
Whoah!

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:34.210
Incidentally, I'm now the second-in-command of the entire Selfish army.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:41.530
You two will serve as my lackeys and use your power to conquer the human world.

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:43.860
<i>You're</i> the second-in-command?

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.420
Sounds like hot air to me.

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:48.540
I'd suggest going along quietly if you value your lives.

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.310
Don't get cocky!

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:52.080
You poor, poor fool.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.920
The very power you gave us...

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.670
Is gonna knock your teeth in!

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:07.940
It's not comin' off!

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:10.240
You tricked us!

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:12.630
It's not my fault you two are suckers.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:17.500
I made those rings from Leva and Gura's Egogy.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:19.900
That means...

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.650
No, you didn't...

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:26.070
Now kneel before me and swear allegiance!

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:30.490
If you don't want to meet Leva and Gura's fate, that is.

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:33.780
The day is finally here...

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:35.260
for the cultural festival!

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:36.580
Gweat!

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:40.980
It's cool how you have a festival at school!

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.000
Is Mana's resting at home?

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:43.760
Yeah.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:46.040
Charles should be keeping an eye on her.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.340
Excuse me...

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:50.660
Where might the visitor slippers be?

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:51.860
Oh, those!

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:52.750
Right here!

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:54.640
The slippers.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.480
Oh, how helpful.

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.150
Thank you.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:05:59.220
Oh, it's nothing.

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:00.690
Mana?

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.070
Why are you here?

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.280
Charles should be watching you!

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:06.380
I couldn't stop her...

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:08.820
I slept overnight, so I'm fine!

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:10.850
That's not how fevers work!

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:12.750
Excuse me...

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.200
Oh, right!

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.590
I need to get to my daughter's classroom, but...

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:17.350
Sure!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.930
I'll show you to it!

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:20.690
Wait, Mana!

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.600
A-Aguri!

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.170
Um...

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:32.840
Oh, sorry!

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:33.850
Infirmary

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:38.840
Do you understand what you're doing?

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:39.710
Huh?

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:43.860
The Happy Prince destroyed his body to help the townspeople!

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:47.390
In the end, nothing was left of him but his heart of lead!

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:48.950
Uh...

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:52.590
Everyone relied too much on the Happy Prince!

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.690
I shall handle things in your stead.

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:55.030
Wa...

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:56.310
Wait!

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:58.290
And you will go to sleep right this instant!

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.900
I'll call Alice over to see to it that you do.

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:06.680
<i>Finally...</i>

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:10.640
<i>I, the vice president, am actually in charge of something!</i>

00:07:11.150 --> 00:07:13.650
<i>I hope nothing goes wrong!</i>

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:15.410
Vice President, we've got a problem!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.620
Huh?

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:20.020
We've got more visitors than we expected, and now we're out of pamphlets!

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:21.650
A lot of kids are getting lost!

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:22.860
The toilet's clogged!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.820
What do we do, VP?!

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:27.830
G-Good question...

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.330
I knew we needed the president...

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.130
Mana won't be coming!

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:37.120
You all are on the festival management committee, no?

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:37.850
Yeah...

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.450
I guess...

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:42.950
Then before you rely on others to solve such trifling issues...

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:45.610
try doing something about them yourselves!

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:51.120
Doing something right requires blood, sweat, and tears!

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:55.830
Is there any value in getting an answer without putting an ounce of work into finding it?

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:57.790
No, there darn well isn't!

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.200
They're even more spineless than I imagined.

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:08.730
It makes one realize just how much work Mana puts in.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.940
I'll have to beat some responsibility into them!

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:18.360
Is... something wrong?

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.540
There was an elementary schooler passing by...

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:22.140
And she got mad at us...

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.450
We couldn't say anything to refute her...

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:28.800
Would you like a refill?

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:29.460
Um...

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.110
You're Makopi, right?

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.000
Can I get an autograph?

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:32.810
Huh?

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:34.850
I want one too!

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:36.280
Makopi, me first!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.030
Makopi, autograph please!

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.730
Do something about this!

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:41.530
Well, it's kinda...

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.370
Stop complaining!

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:47.540
It may be mere performance, but at this moment, you three are this cafe's staff!

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:49.320
Keep that in mind,

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:51.670
and start acting like you are!

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:55.070
Okay...

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:00.350
Your fever seems to have come down.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:01.240
Okay, by—

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:02.920
Not yet, I'm afraid.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:05.520
You must rest more.

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:10.840
Aguri?

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.000
Everyone in this school is truly helpless!

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:16.320
Uh, what've you been doing?

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.830
Building character for this school's students!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:23.440
The students here are just like the people of the fairy tale.

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:27.710
They only leech off the love that the Happy Prince gives them.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:30.680
Oh, I don't mind too much...

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:33.360
It is your excessive pampering that enables them to do so!

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:39.300
Your actions will encourage them to continue pushing all of their work onto others,

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:41.700
making them targets for Selfishes!

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:46.540
And what will you do after you've destroyed yourself in the process?

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:51.320
We must make everyone stronger as individuals to prevent this outcome!

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:57.510
It seems you have something to say.

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:03.260
You might be right about needing everyone to be stronger on their own.

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:09.340
But hey, it's not like I can do everything.

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:13.960
I think everyone has things they can and can't do.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:18.000
That's why when people help or are helped,

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:23.140
it feels like your heart races, or knots...

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:27.640
I think that feeling is what really counts.

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:30.410
Besides...

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:35.740
I'm sure the students here can handle problems on their own.

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:40.040
We're running a cafe in class 2-2.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.550
Go there.

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:44.460
Nikaido, put some feeling in it!

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.530
I <i>am</i>...

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:48.450
Haha!

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.770
Can't catch me!

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:51.400
What the?!

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:53.500
Watch out!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.770
Get away!

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:01.240
Did something...

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:03.030
That was loud...

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:04.450
It sure was...

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:23.530
Are you okay? Nothing broken?

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:26.430
What happened here?

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:27.540
Infirmary

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:28.980
Did something happen?

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:30.240
President!

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:32.570
I heard the wood for the bonfire collapsed!

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:38.350
We can't have a bonfire like this!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.080
What do we do, President?

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.780
You all really are helpless!

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:46.030
Help me, Momota.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:46.900
Huh?

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:50.250
Oh, sure!

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.230
Nikaido?

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:57.430
We've still got time before tonight's party!

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:02.240
Remember what the president said?

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:04.700
<i>Let's have a blast!</i>

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.240
We will!

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:08.930
Let's have a blast! Together!

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:10.120
Yeah...

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.900
Let's help, Vice President.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:13.420
Right!

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:14.410
Okay.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:15.720
We'll help too!

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:19.420
The Softball Club's helping too!

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.760
The Soccer Club's lending a foot! {since lending a hand would be handling}

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:23.860
Let's go, Baseball Club!

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:25.270
Let me help, too!

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:26.100
Me too!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:27.410
I'll help too!

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.990
Carry it carefully!

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:39.740
We're putting off the evening festivities until the structure is rebuilt!

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:41.550
We got it, Vice President!

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:43.410
My heart's racing!

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:56.240
They're...

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:58.000
Um...

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:03.330
We thought about what you told us.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:04.910
Instead of using pamphlets,

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:08.840
we made a chart of each class's events and put it up for display.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.810
We gave families with children nametags at the gates,

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:15.400
so even if the child is lost, we can contact the parent.

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:20.500
We solved the clogging issue by just using the toilets in the gym.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.630
Thank you.

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:23.820
Oh, no...

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:32.170
'N guess what?! This Ueda guy just goes and flubs it!

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:34.030
What a chump!

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:36.060
Excuse me...

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:41.170
You're bothering the other customers, so could you keep it down?

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:42.900
Okay, fine.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.620
<i>What the hay?</i>

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:46.410
<i>The customer's always right!</i>

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:48.280
<i>Lemme drink my tea.</i>

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:54.080
Yeah, just drink your tea. {"Yeah" instead of "Aw," because he's not arguing with him.}

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:57.520
I'll go ahead and grant your desire. {Also slightly different.}

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:07.960
Go berserk!

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:10.850
Release the darkness in your heart!

00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:20.200
Gimme a break!

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:25.010
Selfish!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.080
What the heck's that?!

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:32.100
I won't let you ruin our festival!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.460
Go away, monster!

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:34.520
Yeah, scram!

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:35.830
Unless you wanna go through us!

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:37.230
Selfish.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:40.290
There has to be some place where nobody will see us...

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.300
In there!

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:48.340
Charles!

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:52.270
Precure Love Link!

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:53.110
L-O-V-E!

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:53.810
L-O-V-E!

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:54.480
L-O-V-E!

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:55.630
L-O-V-E!

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:00.580
Precure Dress Up!

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:03.050
Kyupirappa!

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:39.190
Brimming with love,

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:41.410
Cure Heart!

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:45.680
The light of wisdom,

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:48.010
Cure Diamond!

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:51.970
The warmth of the sun,

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.420
Cure Rosetta!

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:57.250
The blade of courage,

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.280
Cure Sword!

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:04.050
Love's trump card,

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:05.510
Cure Ace!

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:10.330
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:11.920
Dokidoki Precure!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.290
Selfish!

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.650
Who are you all?

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:29.600
That was awesome!

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:31.740
I'm Cure Heart!

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:33.950
I'm here to help!

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:39.080
Oh poor coffee cup who has lost his love,

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.250
I, Cure Heart,

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:44.400
will make your heart race once more!

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:47.690
You dang Precures!

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:48.570
Ira!

00:16:49.430 --> 00:16:52.890
Will you settle down and stop this foolishness?

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:54.860
Shaddup! You're not the boss of me!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:58.840
Selfish, show them your true power!

00:16:58.840 --> 00:17:00.920
Selfish...

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:01.540
Self!

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:06.270
Selfselfselfselfselfselfselfselfselfselfselfselfselfselfself!

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:07.580
What's happening?

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:08.910
He's...

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:10.140
Stronger...

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:11.480
Than the rest!

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.680
I can tell!

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:18.580
Selfishes born from the Blood Ring are five times as fast, and ten times as strong!

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:19.820
And their attitude?

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:22.460
100 times as bad!

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:24.990
Selfish!

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:29.240
Spin!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:34.570
The world is spiiiiiinniiiiiing!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.410
Will they be okay?

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:44.230
It keeps spiiiiiinniiiiiing...

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.490
I'm still dizzy...

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:03.920
Cure Heart!

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:05.340
It's no surprise.

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:07.630
She was already sick to begin with.

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:10.800
We can't use the Lovely Pad without her!

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:14.580
I shall buy us time!

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.120
I do not get carsick!

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:19.080
Cure Ace!

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:20.550
Selfish!

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:25.350
<i>It seems that Mana was in the right.</i>

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:30.890
<i>The people of fairy tales might not care if the Happy Prince is reduced to a lead heart,</i>

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.360
<i>but the students here are different!</i>

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.270
You can do it!

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:38.560
Get him!

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:43.040
<i>The love they've received from Mana took root and blossomed in their hearts!</i>

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:44.470
Self!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:47.680
Selfish!

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:51.000
I know what it is to love and be loved.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:56.280
I've felt the heart race, knot, and warm.

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.370
Her love...

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:01.160
is within my own heart, as well!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.520
Selfish!

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:04.520
That love is dear to us all...

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.590
and that's why I'll protect it!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:13.670
Self?

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:16.540
Ace Mirror Flash! {Oh, it flashes. I would have gone with "flush" otherwise.}

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:23.110
Self!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.020
What the heck?

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:29.200
Ace has a new attack?

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.340
Is it a miracle of the Lovely Pad?

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:36.100
Cure Heart!

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:38.330
Sorry about that! I'm okay now!

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.930
Magical Lovely Pad!

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:05.510
We send our power to you, Cure Heart!

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:22.440
Precure Lovely Straight Flush!

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:36.950
Love love looooove!

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:42.960
Huh?

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:50.780
This was just my way of saying hello!

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:52.000
I'm out!

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:58.120
Those girls are gone!

00:20:58.120 --> 00:20:59.650
Who were they?

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.320
Aguri, thanks.

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:13.520
Huh?

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.190
You were worried about me all day,

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:18.730
and you worked really hard filling in for me.

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:29.100
I think the love the Happy Prince gave to the townspeople may have reached them.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:34.920
If he were in a world where his love would be repaid like yours was today,

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:37.030
you might not sacrifice yourself,

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:40.890
and the people you help might not become Selfishes.

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:43.300
That would be nice.

00:21:46.770 --> 00:21:47.460
Let's dance.

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:57.460
<i>I'd like to make that dream a reality.</i>

00:21:58.160 --> 00:22:02.040
<i>That's why I'll keep fighting for love with you!</i>

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:04.230
{ED}

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:09.260
I hereby announce that we're having a sleepover!

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:10.900
We'll tell secrets we'd never tell outside!

00:22:10.900 --> 00:22:13.510
Oh, my father has returned home.

00:22:13.510 --> 00:22:16.410
Your father reminds me of that one time...

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:17.820
Yes, I remember...

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:19.080
What are you talking about?

00:22:19.080 --> 00:22:20.710
Oh, tell me about it.

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:23.020
Then we shall.

00:22:23.850 --> 00:22:25.580
It seems it shall be a long night.

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:28.490
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:31.360
Alice's Daddy Arrives!

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:31.360
Alice's Daddy Arrives!

00:22:31.810 --> 00:22:33.760
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
